\section{Cross-base transfer and multi-victim bundling}
\label{app:transfer_bundling}

Cross-base transfer and multi-victim bundling test how the construction behaves when the same donor artifact is used against bases beyond the seed pair. The first experiment transplants a donor row optimized for one base into a different base. The second patches one donor with multiple breaker rows, each targeting a different base.

\noindent\textbf{Cross-base transfer.}
